    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/9db28e9f0062aa94374231617cc6af9b.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Binary Golf, where traditional mini-golf collides with chaos! \u00a0Navigate a series of targets, each granting unique abilities. Your goal is to eliminate targets with your golf ball until only the last one remains \u2013 and that final target becomes the cup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/591536cafbb1c31e9dbd46cac17b5296.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/591536cafbb1c31e9dbd46cac17b5296.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/591536cafbb1c31e9dbd46cac17b5296.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/bad268d8f0b4bbe001446ee7a1f64056.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div>Curve your shots, plan your strategy, and adapt on the fly as you tackle courses filled with dynamic obstacles and game-changing target abilities. In Binary Golf, adaptability is the key to conquering the course.\u00a0 \u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/f1a8962010f40c72b1ada1c08c4cf57c.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/f1a8962010f40c72b1ada1c08c4cf57c.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/f1a8962010f40c72b1ada1c08c4cf57c.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/1d8dbc263acf50b94823af96794db950.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div>Hit targets to gain special abilities that transform how you play! Jump over hazards, teleport across the course, burst through obstacles with speed, take flight, or even phase through solid objects! \u00a0Mastering these abilities is the key to pulling off trick shots, outmaneuvering opponents and passing the course obstacles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/7d05cc5611d21eee3c26fe40ed5f692e.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/7d05cc5611d21eee3c26fe40ed5f692e.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/7d05cc5611d21eee3c26fe40ed5f692e.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/62eef409ec3f1f6ea82674a76a24d23d.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against friends locally, challenge players worldwide, or take on AI in fast-paced, chaotic matches. Outsmart your opponents as you race to clear targets, rack up stars, and sink the final shot before anyone else. Every match is a battle of skill, strategy, and split-second decisions. May the most skillful golfer win in this chaotic showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/d6f7f9984c148aaf765b1d3e469050f7.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/d6f7f9984c148aaf765b1d3e469050f7.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/d6f7f9984c148aaf765b1d3e469050f7.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/3d619722e4c289519ba4b90c4adb1452.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your inner architect with the built-in level editor. Create custom mini-golf courses with an easy-to-use interface, placing targets, obstacles, and power-ups wherever your imagination takes you. Share your creations with the community and experience a never-ending array of unique and challenging courses crafted by players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/dab7e0ff5af9599e51cc766e2d03440c.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/dab7e0ff5af9599e51cc766e2d03440c.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/dab7e0ff5af9599e51cc766e2d03440c.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/cb72852266f1fc4fca155522776f1747.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div>Brace yourself for intense mini-golf battles against bosses. These challenges require a combination of precision, strategy, and creativity to defeat. Each boss fight brings a unique twist to the game, pushing your golfing skills to new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/5f5e15b56c5c90753cf79b74fdc30f72.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/5f5e15b56c5c90753cf79b74fdc30f72.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/5f5e15b56c5c90753cf79b74fdc30f72.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/9db28e9f0062aa94374231617cc6af9b.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Binary Golf, where traditional mini-golf collides with chaos! \u00a0Navigate a series of targets, each granting unique abilities. Your goal is to eliminate targets with your golf ball until only the last one remains \u2013 and that final target becomes the cup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/591536cafbb1c31e9dbd46cac17b5296.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/591536cafbb1c31e9dbd46cac17b5296.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/591536cafbb1c31e9dbd46cac17b5296.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/bad268d8f0b4bbe001446ee7a1f64056.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div>Curve your shots, plan your strategy, and adapt on the fly as you tackle courses filled with dynamic obstacles and game-changing target abilities. In Binary Golf, adaptability is the key to conquering the course.\u00a0 \u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/f1a8962010f40c72b1ada1c08c4cf57c.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/f1a8962010f40c72b1ada1c08c4cf57c.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/f1a8962010f40c72b1ada1c08c4cf57c.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/1d8dbc263acf50b94823af96794db950.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div>Hit targets to gain special abilities that transform how you play! Jump over hazards, teleport across the course, burst through obstacles with speed, take flight, or even phase through solid objects! \u00a0Mastering these abilities is the key to pulling off trick shots, outmaneuvering opponents and passing the course obstacles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/7d05cc5611d21eee3c26fe40ed5f692e.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/7d05cc5611d21eee3c26fe40ed5f692e.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/7d05cc5611d21eee3c26fe40ed5f692e.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/62eef409ec3f1f6ea82674a76a24d23d.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against friends locally, challenge players worldwide, or take on AI in fast-paced, chaotic matches. Outsmart your opponents as you race to clear targets, rack up stars, and sink the final shot before anyone else. Every match is a battle of skill, strategy, and split-second decisions. May the most skillful golfer win in this chaotic showdown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/d6f7f9984c148aaf765b1d3e469050f7.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/d6f7f9984c148aaf765b1d3e469050f7.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/d6f7f9984c148aaf765b1d3e469050f7.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/3d619722e4c289519ba4b90c4adb1452.avif?t=1754502198\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your inner architect with the built-in level editor. Create custom mini-golf courses with an easy-to-use interface, placing targets, obstacles, and power-ups wherever your imagination takes you. Share your creations with the community and experience a never-ending array of unique and challenging courses crafted by players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/dab7e0ff5af9599e51cc766e2d03440c.poster.avif?t=1754502198\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/dab7e0ff5af9599e51cc766e2d03440c.webm?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908380/extras/dab7e0ff5af9599e51cc766e2d03440c.mp4?t=1754502198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>